  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 212.02 Standard and Burden of Proof. The party asserting a proposition shall bear the burden of proving the truth of the proposition by a preponderance of the evidence.\n\nSource. #7382, eff 10-25-00, EXPIRED: 10-25-08\n\nNew. #9332, INTERIM, eff 11-27-08, EXPIRED: 5-26-09\n\nNew. #9636-A, eff 1-12-10",
